{"kind": "mod", "id": 1858, "name": "Enemy Markers", "slug": "enemy-markers", "teaser": "Simply a Marker that shows the enemies with a \"v\" shaped marker. Can also display the distance from the enemy.", "owner_name": "APerson", "downloads": 18510, "favourites": 17, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "The Unlicense", "guid": "flir.enemymarkers", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T06:27:20.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-11-28T23:35:10.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-11-28T23:35:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "latest_version": "1.3.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/unlicense/", "description_html": "<p><strong>I (APerson) AM NOT THE ORIGINAL CREATOR OF THIS MOD</strong></p>\n<p>This mod gives you the ability to spot an enemy and have a Marker showing where they are for <strong>5 Seconds</strong>.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/flir063-spt/enemymarkers/-/raw/master/resources/scav.png?ref_type=heads&amp;inline=false\" alt=\"scav scoped\" /></p>\n<p>Configurable:</p>\n<p>Marker character</p>\n<p>Size</p>\n<p>Distance / Radius from center</p>\n<p>Color by “player” category (Bear/Usec/Scav/Boss …)</p>\n<p>To install just unzip at the root of your SPT folder and it will create a <code>BepInEx\\\\plugins\\\\flir.enemymarkers</code> directory for you</p>\n<h3>If you want to help in the development of this mod you are welcome to propose merge requests or issues on its project page: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://gitlab.com/flir063-spt/enemymarkers\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://gitlab.com/flir063-spt/enemymarkers</a></h3>\n<p>Do not make requests somewhere else than gitlab as I would not see them, I (flir) am not the “author” of this mod, just an additional author.</p>\n<p>Special Thx to Level-Yellow-316 on Reddit for originally making this mod.</p>\n<p>Known Issues</p>\n<p>none ATM</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.4", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 4184, "published_at": "2025-05-04T12:43:26.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1858/enemy-markers/1.0.4", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.6", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 10831, "downloads": 101, "published_at": "2025-11-05T20:32:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1858/enemy-markers/1.0.6", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.7", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 11058, "downloads": 379, "published_at": "2025-11-05T21:33:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1858/enemy-markers/1.0.7", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.8", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 11644, "downloads": 291, "published_at": "2025-11-09T00:13:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1858/enemy-markers/1.0.8", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 11738, "downloads": 196, "published_at": "2025-11-10T22:27:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1858/enemy-markers/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 11861, "downloads": 212, "published_at": "2025-11-11T1